            <ArticleTitle>Diaphragmatic crus lipoma: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>421-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Diaphragmatic crus lipoma is a very rare entity. In this case report, smooth, rounded masses of diaphragmatic lipoma, incidentally observed in a 37-year-old female on routine abdominal computed tomographic scanning is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
